      "latin": "Quintus Hears about His Brother’s Troubles",
      "english": "",
      "kind": "topic",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "text": "From his sickbed Quintus calls Syra and asks her to tell him what has been going on while he has been lying alone and feeling left out of things. Syra readily gives him all the details of Marcus’s return home and what had gone before."
        }
      ],
      "id": "topic"
